Why the hell are you in Cleveland.  That's like 4 hours away.

MIKEY
Oh, I'm taking the kids to a hockey tournament.  Ryan has a tournament and I am taking Amber and Fisher too.  It's something!

NONA
Oh, Mikey that sounds like fun!  I always liked going on the trips with the kids.  

MIKEY
You would think it would be but you spend so much time traveling, and in the hotel, and at the tournament.  But, but the hotel has a pool on the 12th floor so the kids love that.  And then -

Mika interrupts.

MIKA
Yes, great, Cleveland.  What about the pictures.  When!

MIKEY
Well, Monday.  Or maybe today or tomorrow.  I would have to call someone at the office.  I think maybe Elly could do it.  Yeah, that could work.  Do you want me to call Elly?

MIKA
Mikey, that would is good idea.  That, is an actually good idea.

Nona looks disparagingly.

She hakes head at him.

MIKEY
Hey Fisher.  Stop.  STOP.  Hey you have to stop that.  Come on, now!  Nona, Mikey, let me - Fisher give it to him - let me call Elly and then I will call you.

MIKA
That sounds good.

NONA
OK, be safe Mikey.  I will text you where to go!

MIKEY
Of course!  I'll call like in a half hour.  Fisher!

The phone call stops abruptly.

MIKA
I don't think -

NONA
This guy knows what he is doing.  Yes, yes. You keep saying that.  The problem was with the camera.  It can be solved.

Mika pushes chair away and rises from the table.

MIKA
What the hell kind of names are those.  Ryan, Fisher, Amber.  Was it Amber?  Soon, names will be Coyote and Shooting Star.  Native Americans will say 'You have to take that from us too?'

NONA
Be one thing - one thing Mika - nice.  That child never had a mother.  Never.

MIKA
That child is selling that house.

INT. COFFEE SHOP 

MIKA is surrounded by FRIENDS 1-3.

Others are there as well.

Two play a backgammon game.

One wears a Viet Nam veteran hat.

MIKA
Bull shit.  He did not have a mother when growing up.  This, this is true.  No mother for many years.  But is not a 'sob story'.  This is not Orphan Annie.  Mother did not die in child birth.  So it is fine.

FRIEND 2
Annie, she had Daddy Warbucks.  That's no sob story either.

FRIEND 3
Warbucks, like was he a defense contractor?  Never saw it.  But I like the name. Warbucks.

Mika says the following.

