Tampa is great. Tampa's great!  You guys get down there watch the sunset on the Gulf it's amazing.

Viet Nam vet comments from the backgammon game.

VIET NAM VET
I liked riding my bike in Tampa a lot. When I did ride.  They have these biker HOV lanes. It was wonderful.

FRIEND 3
What did you ride?

VIET NAM VET
I had a Heritage Softail.  It was nice, not too heavy.  You always have to be worried about the turns with heavy bikes.  The Softail was fine.  But the I went and bought a - .

MIKA
Yes, yes.  Tampa is amazing.  Mikey's mother leave Ivan, the father, years ago.  Why, not sure.   Maybe she was cheating.  Maybe she just did not want to be around Ivan ... or Mikey 

Mika sips coffee.  

MIKA
But she move there with a carpet installer.  Remarried to the installer and had two more kids.  Maybe come up once or twice year.  But not to see Mikey so much, which I have to admit is odd.  So, it is true, he have no mother, at least not one that really wanted to see him.  

FRIEND 3
Hey, man, that is rough.  I mean, I can't.  Like, I can't imagine what it's like to know your mom is still around.  And she has two other kids.  But, she sort of could care less about you.  That's gotta do something to you. It cannot be easy.  No way.

MIKA
Yes, it did something to him.  It made him an absolute moron.  Ivan, the father, is not the brightest guy.  

Mika sips his coffee again.

MIKA
The kid was a mess.  The milk incident.

FRIEND 2
The what incident? Mika, man, it's called context man, context.

Friends laugh.

MIKA
The milk incident is perfect example of why something wrong with him.  Let me explain.

VIET NAME VET
Please do.  

MIKA
